# The verdict the migration scan must give each disk of this variant (doc 05 §3). The
# builder measures every row on the disks and refuses to build a variant whose
# rows the disks do not show; expected/scan.txt is this file with those facts.
# The boot device is classed as Unraid's boot device: never adopted, never
# refused as a ZFS data disk. The array proceeds, and the Flash Backup zip is
# the only configuration source.
disk parity parity
disk disk1 adopt
disk disk2 adopt
disk disk3 adopt
disk boot boot-device
config-source zip
